Just plug the snippet into your service, feed it the client’s IP (or let the framework give you the request object), and you’ll automatically greet users in the language that matches their **geographical location**. If you need any language‑specific tweaks (e.g., formal vs. informal greetings) let me know – we can extend the logic with a tiny locale‑map. Happy coding!

